<title>LATVIA: UBAK CRANE FIRM ON PUBLIC OFFER IN JUNE.</title>
<headline>UBAK CRANE FIRM ON PUBLIC OFFER IN JUNE.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>A 20 percent stake in UBAK crane company will be on public offer from June 2 untill June 27, the privatisation agency said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The controlling stake, 48 percent or 864,000 shares, is held by an individual, Konstantin Kovalyov.</p>
<p>The company earlier registered a 1996 loss of 22,100 lats on net turnover of 278,500 lats and its balance sheet total came to 636,200 lats.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
